\viewkind4\uc1\pard\tx3780\tx3960\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Holy Spirit, God,
\par All loveliness is Thine;
\par Great things and small are both in Thee,
\par The star-world is Thy shine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The sunshine Thou of God,
\par The life of man and flower,
\par The wisdom and the energy 
\par That fills the world with power.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thou art the stream of love,
\par The unity divine ;
\par Good men and true are one in Thee,
\par And in Thy radiance shine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The heroes and the saints
\par Thy messengers became; 
\par And all the lamps that guide the world
\par Were kindled at Thy flame.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. The calls that come to us
\par Upon Thy winds are brought ;
\par The light that gleams beyond our dreams
\par Is something Thou hast thought.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Give fellowship, we pray,
\par In love and joy and peace,
\par That we in counsel, knowledge, might,
\par And wisdom, may increase.\tab 
\par                                Amen.\i 
\par \pard\i0\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

